    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Moon elf mummy from the elven tomb (E4).</strong> Chaotic good. Acclimated to cold weather. Smells like pumpkin spice.</p>\n<p>Sealed in the sarcophagus for hundreds of years. Knows nothing about Ten-Towns or current affairs. Knows how the moon dial functions.</p>\n<p>Follows the commands of whoever freed it until reduced to 0 HP, whereupon it crumbles to dust. If given conflicting orders, follows whichever it deems most sensible (INT 6 \u2014 can make bad choices).</p>\n<p><strong>Opening the sarcophagus:</strong> Place pinecone + twig + feather + severed humanoid hand in the E3 brazier and light it. The fire burns for a tenday and can't be extinguished.</p>\n<p><strong>DM:</strong> If returned to Ten-Towns, needs to be disguised \u2014 the mummy form will frighten townsfolk.</p>"
      },
